            "line": 810,
            "text": "theorem S_eq_integral (w : ResetWitness d K) {Amp : ℝ → ℝ} (ha : ContDiff ℝ ∞ Amp) (y eta : ℝ) :\n    S w Amp (y, eta) = ∫ t in Iic y, Real.exp t * (U d Amp (t, eta) ^ 2 - E w (t, eta) ^ 2 / 2)"
